00099E  1  20 37 0A         JSR CalcGenerationsText
0009A1  1               @SetupIRQ:
0009A1  1  A9 00 8D C5      DUART_IRQ_DISABLE                           ; turn off timer interrupts, we are going to use VDP frames instead
0009A5  1  BF           
0009A6  1  A5 ED 8D 03      COPY16 InterruptVector, SystemInterrupt     ; preserve old value of the interrupt vector
0009AA  1  06 A5 EE 8D  
0009AE  1  04 06        
